/// single-letter `tag:value` pairs, matching gif 89a's `GifFrameDiff` convention (`LasVlrDiff`:
/// `U`/`R`/`N`/`X`; `LasPointDiff`: `X`/`Y`/`Z`/`I`/`R`/`N`/`D`/`E`/`C`/`A`/`U`/`P`/`G`/`B` — each
