//#region 🔖️ValueBinaryCodecs
/// 🧪️ P2-FG1-FIX: real recursive binary twins of [`enc_vec3`]/[`enc_vertices`]/[`enc_triangle`]
/// above — genuinely flat (no self-recursion, `StlTriangle` never references itself), so every
